  "description": {
    "text": "The Plusle Minun Tag Battle was a side event at Battle Road Spring 2006 where two players formed a team and shared one deck: 58 cards of their own plus two Touch Exchange!, Sumiyoshi Kizuki's tag-battle-only card with Plusle and Minun, which swaps the partners' hands. Every player got two copies, and teams that won two battles got six holo basic Energies, 055 to 060/PCG-P."
